WEBVTT

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:32.904
and you can see
that from the perspective of the camera

00:06:32.928 --> 00:06:34.015
or the human eye,

00:06:34.039 --> 00:06:36.790
hardly a stick or a tree
appears to be out of place,

00:06:36.814 --> 00:06:39.730
which would confirm the logging
company's contention

00:06:39.754 --> 00:06:42.359
that there's nothing
of environmental impact.

00:06:42.383 --> 00:06:48.776
However, our ears tell us
a very different story.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.603
Young students are always asking me

00:06:50.627 --> 00:06:52.056
what these animals are saying,

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:56.887
and really I've got no idea.

00:06:56.911 --> 00:07:02.156
But I can tell you that they do
express themselves.